{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/08/6468085/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば無事に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピスタチオ味のマカロン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/08/6468085/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べられました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(武道館アンダラ初日かな？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/08/6468085/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木神社で\n生駒さんとまりかさんと真洋さんの\n成人式がありましたね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくキレイで\nニュースでもみました(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式でニュースといえば\n去年の成人式での能條さんのインタビュー中にカラスが鳴き始めたことを思い出して\n1人で数分にやにやしてました(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年の成人式は\n私たち96年組ですね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今からドキドキ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社での成人式の振袖は\n用意して頂いているものですが、\n地元の成人式で着る振袖は\n自分で選ぶので違う色だといいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年の地元の人たちは\nもう振袖を選び終わっているみたいですが\n私は明日から選び出すので\n決められるか不安ー(｡-_-｡)。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月中には決めたいですね(｡-_-｡)\nいや、もっと早くきめないとかっ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなのにしようかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/08/6468085/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もここで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/08/6468085/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆まりぱん！さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは車運転してみたい？\n私は免許取りに行こうと思ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎してみたいです！車って乗れるようになったらとても便利ですよね！\n免許取るの頑張ってみようかな！\n今日から2年間のうちに\n挑戦してみようかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆クンさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁チップが人間だったら彼氏にしたい？彼女にしたい？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎彼氏でも彼女でもない！妹！\nいや！妹でもないかな？うーん、チップはチップだからなー。。。チップかわいいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ぼーほさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁テストの全くわからない問題の選択肢\n①②③④\n迷ったらどれ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎③→②→④→①の順番で埋めていくかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆春のメロディーフラッグさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃん、炭酸のジュースは好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎だいすき！炭酸のジュース！ジュースがすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆いぬ！さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁日奈子ちゃん御守買いましたか？買ったとしたら何の御守買いましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎買いましたよ！！！秘密ー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秘密にする必要ないけど、なんとなく秘密ー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ムーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きぃちゃんはチャーシュー麺好きですか？\n僕が大好きなので気になります‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎チャーシュー麺すきです！今、チャーシュー麺が頭に浮かんでないけど、食べたことあると思うしたぶんすきです！いや、絶対すきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆たくみんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁日奈子の必殺技は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎がおーと威嚇顔！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必殺技もそうだけど、最近ね、キャッチフレーズが欲しいなって思ってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆所沢のけんけんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁スパゲッティで一番好きな味は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎お父さんの作るカルボナーラ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆所沢のけんけんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ドリンクバーで一番最初に飲む飲み物は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎メロンソーダ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ちゃっきーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁日奈子って真ん中っ子なの？？？\nあとさ、そろそろチップの作った方がいいかな？？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎日奈子は、真ん中っ子だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん！作ったほうがいいよ！笑\nしろみときみの分も！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/08/6468085/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナコセレクト(仮)はこれでおわりです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のブログはあしたの\n個別握手会についてかくね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたの1部2部は\n巫女さんの袴きるよ(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんときれるかな。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクとヘア早く終わらせて\n袴と格闘しないと！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/08/6468085/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/08/6468085/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんのほっぺた\n吸い上げてるみたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/08/6468085/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、おやすみなさい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント欄がうまく開けなくて\n今日のブログの冒頭あいさつとおわりの挨拶は皆さんの中から選べませんでした(ノ_・。)\nごめんなさい(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のブログは\n冒頭あいさつもおわりの挨拶も\nコメントの中から選びます！"}],"source":"archive"}